# Build context rules for deploy/Dockerfile (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# before a .dockerignore in the context). The source target sends the whole
# checkout: keep secrets, data and build output out of it. GoReleaser's
# context holds only <os>/<arch>/wardlockd, which nothing here matches.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
deploy/vps/wardlock.env
deploy/vps/restic.env
